{"id": "idaho-3", "headline": "Idaho legislator pay frozen for a year, then set to rise", "source": "Idaho Capital Sun", "url": "https://idahocapitalsun.com/2026/11/19/after-state-employees-didnt-get-raises-in-2026-idaho-state-legislator-pay-frozen-for-1-year/", "published": "2026-11-19", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Idaho legislators will keep their $25,000 base pay for the next year, the Idaho Capital Sun reports. The Citizens Committee on Legislative Compensation voted 5-1 Thursday to hold pay flat, in line with state employees who got no raise this year. On Dec. 1, 2027, base pay rises about 6.7% to $26,685. House Speaker Mike Moyle had recommended the raise start this December. Members Tom Harris and Bryan Mooney noted state employees went without raises. The constituent services allowance will rise to a flat $6,000 for all legislators, up from $2,500 for most. Lawmakers cannot set their own pay under the Idaho Constitution. The 2027 session starts Jan. 11. Source: Idaho Capital Sun"], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110011011001101110110100111101111111", "10000010100110111100111000111000001000001", "10111010001100111000010010001000101011101", "10111010110011110100001101101100001011101", "10111010000110100001100100001011001011101", "10000010111110111000001001011010001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000001110110011011010010001100000000", "11111011111011110100001001010100110101010", "10010001001101101111100110100111111111011", "10000111010000011110001000111010101010010", "00101001001010110010111010111000000111010", "00010110111101101100101011000101100001100", "10000001011010000011111100001111011011101", "11100110001001011000010010010000010101000", "01101000010010111001111000011011000011010", "10101011101011001110101101010100000001100", "10001001111110001011110111101001111110001", "11101110010010111000100000111000011110000", "10100000010000101001010100101010000001000", "10000111110011100100000111101100100101100", "1110110001100100011